  "plain": "Mick West, a researcher known for doubting UFO claims, says that in 2019 a team of trained lookouts on a US Navy ship, called the Snoopy team, mistook stars for drones, and that a jet was also called a drone. He tells it on a podcast hosted by Jesse Michels to argue that even trained military observers can get things wrong."
